## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **q1 STITCH per-shot trim** — confirmed by: `ffprobe -show_entries format=duration` on re-fired STITCH event mp4 → `54.231000s` (vs prior 96s). File `public/staging/final-cut-763c5c1e-...-613bd1ae73f1.mp4`, 9.97 MB, h264/aac 1280×720. New v03-DRAFT asset row landed in Supabase.
- **Seedance 1.0 Pro Fast img2vid probe (`bytedance/seedance-2.0/fast/image-to-video`, 5s, 16:9, 720p)** — confirmed by: 4 frames extracted via ffmpeg showed clear orbit-left camera move with location reveal (cream walls, additional shelves, floor tiles). $1.19 billed, 103s wall clock, 2.86 MB mp4.
- **Seedance 2.0 Standard img2vid 8s dance + 360° probe** — confirmed by: 6 extracted frames (t=0, 1.57, 3.15, 4.72, 6.29, 7.87s) show characters holding partner-grip hands while camera completes ~340° orbit; location revealed from all angles. $2.42 billed, 7 min wall clock, 6.4 MB mp4. Director called it "фантастика — надо интегрировать".
- **`lib/agents/providers/fal-seedance.ts`** — confirmed by: 11 unit tests with mocked global.fetch all pass (slug resolution, env override, fal parent-truncated URL quirk, cost math, 429/FAILED surfacing, inline data-URL composition, [4,15] duration clamp).
- **Multi-provider router refactor** — confirmed by: `vitest run` all 198 tests green (was 187 → +11 fal-seedance), `replay-pilot` 29/29 green (mock pipeline unaffected by real provider wiring).
- **Provider dropdown UI** (`VGENShotPanel.tsx` + `EpisodeTimelineSection.tsx`) — confirmed by: tsc --noEmit clean after the changes, cost preview is provider-aware (Seedance Fast $0.2419/s vs Veo Fast $0.075/s shown in label).
- **Migration 0028 applied** — confirmed by: `npx supabase db push` output "Finished supabase db push" + verification SQL `provider_assignments.character_video.active_provider_id = 'seedance-fal-img2vid'`.
- **Real Seedance Fast probe post-refactor** — confirmed by: `npx tsx scripts/test-orbit-fal.ts 'bytedance/seedance-2.0/fast/image-to-video' 5` → 103s wall clock, 2.5 MB mp4, $1.21, video.url retrieved correctly. Slug + env + URL quirks all unchanged after the refactor.
- **Plan file written + checkpoint memo + PLAN.md rotated** — confirmed by: all three files exist on disk; MEMORY.md top entry 🚀 pointing to checkpoint memo.

